          │                                                                              │
          │ commits   ▌[conventional]                                                    │
          │ branch     [task/{slug}]                                                     │
          │ co-author                                                                    │
          │ copyright                                                                    │
          │ license                                                                      │
          │ template   [detected]                                                        │
          │                                                                              │
          │ ✓ learned from your repo                                                     │
          │   5 of 5 recent commits use Conventional Commits                             │
          │                                                                              │
          │ template: a ready-made naming scheme (branches, commit subjects, PR text).   │
          │ co-author: "Name <email>", added to commits as a Co-Authored-By trailer.     │
          │ copyright: the holder named in new-file headers; license is an SPDX id (MIT) │
          │                                                                              │
